# --- SQLite ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Journal/WAL sidecar files are always transient.
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite-journal
# Note: databases themselves are NOT ignored, because some SQLite exercises
# ship a fixture database that the tests need. If a track turns out to
# generate throwaway .db files instead, uncomment the next line.
# *.db


